    "sections": {
        "description": "<h3>Payment method that can be easily integrated</h3>\n<p>Self-payment checkout.</p>\n<p>The best rates in the market.</p>\n<p>Accept payments by PIX and credit card.</p>\n<p>Installment payment.</p>\n<p>To learn more about Parcelow visit our website: www.parcelow.com.br</p>\n<p>To use our payment method, just enroll here: https://precadastro.parcelow.com/</p>\n<p>After your registration is approved you will be given access credentials to the API.</p>\n<p>If you need help, contact us by sending an e-mail to integracao@parcelow.com</p>\n"
    },
